<title>UK: Banner predicts profit increase.</title>
<headline>Banner predicts profit increase.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Housebuilding group Banner Homes Plc said on Thursday it expected pretax profits of not less than 1.8 million stg for the year to March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>The group said housebuilding had traded above expectations towards the end of its financial year, and it had also made significant profits from the sale of land and a commercial property.</p>
<p>In the year to March 31, 1996, Banner made pretax profits of 751,000 stg.</p>
<p>Banner's shares were 9.5 pence higher at 70.5 pence by 1520 GMT. -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
